Error: Jet.OutputSettingUndeclared: This output's options set `max_partcles`, which the package does not declare
  --> Tests/UI/OutputSettingUndeclared/run.jet:3:74
    |
  3 |     fast: b.add_executable("fast", ["run.jet"], [], options: {settings: {max_partcles: 2000}})
    |                                                                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: An output's `options: {settings: ...}` gives its own values to the settings `package.jet` declares, and code reads them as `#build.settings.<key>`
 Fix: Declare `max_partcles: Type = default` in the `settings: { … }` block of `package.jet`, or drop it from the output's options
